### Listar cajas
GET {{api_url}}/cashboxes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Crear caja
POST {{api_url}}/cashboxes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Caja Secundaria",
  "status": "active",
  "branch_office_id": 1
}

### Eliminar caja
DELETE {{api_url}}/cashboxes/28
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver cajas activas
GET {{api_url}}/cashier-init
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Cerrar caja
PUT {{api_url}}/cashier-close/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "end_balance": 1000
}
